comments.body:
Quest pieces are in stacks of boxes randomly in the caves east of the North Guard tower.&nbsp; Levels of mobs are around 10-14 with an occasional 15 in the mix.&nbsp; There is one named monster in the back section of the caves that was level 14 when he spawned.&nbsp; 

Three battered chests pop in the cave (one up in the middle and two in the last room) and one chest pops in the camp outside the entrance to the cave.&nbsp; 

Green drops are good.&nbsp; These mobs have fire shields cast on them that does damage to you when you hit them.&nbsp; Also, watch out for adds, the spawn rate is quick.&nbsp; Generally a couple paladins with a mage can own this "dungeon" fairly well if you stick together.&nbsp; 

The quest drops are really easy to get if you can survive cause there are a lot of them.
